				 "example": "A(−1, −2)、B(3, 4)：m = \\frac{6}{4} = \\frac{3}{2}",
				 "check": {"q": "斜率 2 的直線，和它垂直的直線斜率是？", "opts": ["−\\frac{1}{2}", "\\frac{1}{2}", "−2"], "a": 0,
